/*
 * 86Box    A hypervisor and IBM PC system emulator that specializes in
 *          running old operating systems and software designed for IBM
 *          PC systems and compatibles from 1981 through fairly recent
 *          system designs based on the PCI bus.
 *
 *          This file is part of the 86Box distribution.
 *
 *          ATI Rage 128 Pro -- host-side register harness, a consistency
 *          and regression tool.
 *
 *          The harness includes the production device shell source and
 *          the Rage Fury MAXX board source directly, so the vectors drive
 *          the same static register read and write handlers and PCI
 *          handlers the emulator uses, with no copies to go stale.
 *
 *          The vectors encode documentation constraints and independent
 *          expected outcomes for the modeled device. This is a regression
 *          tool, not a hardware oracle (see README.md).
 *
 * Authors: skiretic.
 *
 *          Copyright 2026 skiretic.
 */
